## ✅ 12. Makefile (pro Linux/macOS)

```makefile
CC = gcc
CFLAGS = -Wall -Wextra -std=c99
LIBS = -lSDL2 -lSDL2_image

snake: main.c
	$(CC) $(CFLAGS) -o snake main.c $(LIBS)

clean:
	rm -f snake

run: snake
	./snake
```

Spusť:
```bash
make run
```

